### Change 5: Expert + Employee Router Modules Added to Core API

v2 said: Core API only had jobs, applications, kanban, profile, employer.
v3 says: Core API gains expert.py and employee.py router modules.

WHY: App.tsx shows these live routes guarded by RoleGuard:
  /expert/dashboard         -> ExpertDashboardPage
  /expert/calendar-settings -> CalendarSettingsPage
  /expert/inbox             -> InboxPage (shared)
  /employee/dashboard       -> EmployeeDashboardPage
  /employee/timesheets      -> EmployeeDashboardPage (TODO: dedicated page)
  /employee/payroll         -> EmployeeDashboardPage (TODO: dedicated page)
  /employee/inbox           -> InboxPage (shared)

These are NOT separate microservices — they live in core_api_service to avoid
premature complexity while the FE pages are still placeholder dashboards.

