### Change 6: InboxPage is Shared Across ALL Authenticated Roles

v2 said: Notifications only delivered to Candidates.
v3 says: /notifications/inbox is consumed by ALL authenticated users.

WHY: App.tsx mounts InboxPage under 4 different role guards:
  /candidate/inbox, /expert/inbox, /employee/inbox, /employer/inbox

GET /notifications/inbox must NOT filter by role — return all notifications
for the authenticated user_id regardless of role.

