When called with Authorization: Bearer <token>, GET /jobs should optionally include:
  - ai_match_score (from ai_results collection)
  - is_saved (whether candidate saved this job to Kanban)
  - application_status (if already applied)

Same endpoint — it just enriches its response when auth context is present.

