### Change 10: ATS Score Shape Must Match FE ATSScore Interface

v2 said: ATS score stored; shape loosely defined.
v3 says: Exact shape defined in web/src/types/ai.types.ts:

  export interface ATSScore {
    overall: number;
    skillMatch: number;
    experienceFit: number;
    keywordDensity: number;
    formatting: number;
    keywords: { keyword: string; found: boolean }[];
    suggestions: string[];
  }

BE ai_results.ats_score MongoDB field MUST serialize to this exact camelCase shape.
Use Pydantic model_config = ConfigDict(alias_generator=to_camel) or explicit aliases.

---

### Change 11: Job Response Must Include More Fields

v2 said: Basic job fields.
v3 says: BE should return (and FE Job type should add):
  salaryCurrency, salaryDisplay, companyId, employerId,
  applicantsCount, expiresAt, aiMatchScore (when auth present),
  isSaved (when auth present), applicationStatus (when auth present)

---

### Change 12: HashRouter — NGINX Config Simplified

v2 said: NGINX serves SPA (implied path-based routing).
v3 says: FE uses HashRouter (web/src/App.tsx line 2). NGINX always serves
         index.html for / — it never handles FE route paths. Only /api/*
         needs to be proxied to services.

URL staging.recruitzaa.com/#/candidate/dashboard — everything after # is
handled 100% by the browser. Server only sees staging.recruitzaa.com/.

