| Topic | Decision |
|---|---|
| Messaging | Apache Kafka (KRaft mode, no Zookeeper) |
| File Storage | MinIO (self-hosted S3-compatible on VPS) |
| DB Hosting | Self-hosted (Docker on VPS) |
| AI Strategy | Hybrid: Ollama (offline) + OpenAI GPT-4o (paid) |
| AI Context | Sliding window + summarization (minimize token costs) |
