| Email | Resend (3000/month free tier) |
| Employer Verify | 3-step: email domain -> admin review -> approved |
| Salary | Multi-currency (ISO 4217 + Frankfurter API) |
| Observability | Prometheus + Grafana + Loki + Tempo |
| Docker | Docker Compose (dev + prod VPS) |
| Auth Providers | Firebase: Email/Password + Google + GitHub + LinkedIn OIDC |
| Roles (NEW) | 5 roles: CANDIDATE, EMPLOYER, EXPERT, EMPLOYEE, SUPER_ADMIN |
| Multi-Role (NEW) | Users can hold multiple roles — Launchpad selects active session role |
